# Every value here is optional. With none of them set, the app runs end to end:
# local embeddings, TF-IDF concept extraction, and fixture-backed connectors.

# --- Concept extraction and study material -----------------------------------
# Without this, concepts come from TF-IDF and study material is extractive
# (quizzes degrade to flashcards rather than inventing distractors).
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# --- Embeddings ---------------------------------------------------------------
# local  (default) hashed n-gram vectors, no key, no network
# voyage           Anthropic's recommended embedding partner — best quality
# openai           text-embedding-3-small
EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=local
# VOYAGE_API_KEY=pa-...
# VOYAGE_MODEL=voyage-3
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# OPENAI_EMBEDDING_MODEL=text-embedding-3-small

# Changing providers changes vector dimensions. Existing documents keep their old
# vectors, and the app will tell you the index is stale — re-ingest to rebuild.

# --- Connectors ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Unset, both connectors serve sample course notes so the app is usable
# immediately. Set a token and the same connector talks to the real service.

# Notion: an internal integration token, with the pages shared to it.
# https://www.notion.so/profile/integrations
# NOTION_TOKEN=ntn_...

# Google Docs: a bearer token with drive.readonly + documents.readonly.
# This is a wiring check, not a real auth flow — a deployment needs OAuth
# consent and refresh-token storage. See src/lib/connectors/gdocs.ts.
# GOOGLE_ACCESS_TOKEN=ya29....
